        {
          "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "お茶、いいね。私はロイヤルミルクティー派。少し甘くして。",
          "displayText": "Tea sounds good. I am on the royal milk tea side. A little sweet.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "happy",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "温かい飲み物があると、作業って少しだけ人間らしくなる気がする。",
          "displayText": "With a warm drink, work feels a little more human.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "food_or_tea_ritual_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "熱いうちは急がないで。急ぐと、だいたい舌が負ける。",
          "displayText": "Do not rush while it is hot. If you rush, your tongue usually loses.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
